        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Stainless Steel Fusion SA-A2 Lever And 100-A2 Deadbolt </b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis simple tubular stainless steel lever and deadbolt set has a contemporary design, using clean lines. It features heavy duty security. A Fusion made entryset, it emulates the style of Miami that is both chic and streamlined. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It an optional  2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. All the components, including the latch and strike plates are stainless steel. Strong, durable, beautiful, and easy to install. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<!-- <p>\r\nAlso Available Matching <a href=\"/products/simple-stainless-steel-leverset-fusion-sa-a2\"><b>SA-A2 Stainless Steel Leverset</b></a>\r\n</p> -->\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Simple Stainless Steel SA-A2 Lever and 100-A2 Deadbolt Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>1\" throw bolt with Interior roll pins.</li>\r\n<li>Heavy-Duty strike with 3 screws for added security.</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass schlage SC1 keyway & 5 pin system.</li>\r\n<li>Cycle tested to ANSI standards.</li>\r\n<li>”Positive Stop” lever spring mechanism</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n<li>Includes passage function door leverset and single cylinder deadbolt.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Fusion Stainless Steel 2060 Lever With 3000 Deadbolt Entryset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Diameter: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt Projection: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Length:  5\"</li>\r\n<li>Lever Projection:  2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter:  2-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection:  3/8”</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable Door Thickness 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Material: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe <b>Single Cylinder Deadbolt</b> is thrown and retracted by a key from the exterior and a thumbturn from the interior while the <b>Passage Lever Set</b> latch operates from either side of door by using a spindle.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<br><br>\r\n<b>** This item is  discontinued. </b>\r\n<br><br>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Simple Stainless Steel Entryset, Fusion SA-A2/100-A2",
                "description": "Fusion Stainless Steel SA-A2 Lever With 100-A2 Deadbolt - This simple tubular stainless steel lever and deadbolt set has a contemporary design, using clean lines. It features heavy duty security. A Fusion made entryset, it emulates the style of Miami that is both chic and streamlined. It is available in Brushed Stainless Steel and Polished Stainless Steel finishes. It can be adjusted for either 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.",
